    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: On test-town, 'Squad' (Friend, TKB 302) with 'Leader' and 'Rifleman 1-4' is ordered SuppressAndManeuver (30 s phase timeout) and waits for contact with 'Hostile' (armed, idle, 100000 HP) at (360,320). Shows a base of fire plus a flank assault the terrain chooses. Judge: (1) on contact the squad splits into a base of fire and an assault; (2) base members fire (ammo falls) and hold within 5 m; (3) the assault takes a terrain-asked flank, at least 45 degrees off the base's bearing; (4) it goes through the enemy's position. Fail: no split, the base does not fire or wanders, or the assault attacks from the base's side. Check: none (no live check); rail SquadTacticsScenarioTests (CE-2123 S1, Hrot.ClusterRunner.Integration.Tests)."
  },
